    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/480627107b78b3170c49f93c7991e6dd.poster.avif?t=1741530002\" width=612 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/480627107b78b3170c49f93c7991e6dd.webm?t=1741530002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/480627107b78b3170c49f93c7991e6dd.mp4?t=1741530002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dying is part of the job</h2>Prepare to die a lot in this game, but always in a rewarding way. Each time you die, you learn more about the game mechanics, unlock new stuff and spend what you've collected to get stronger. Collect all 5 seals to save yourself from the uncertain future.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rogue-lite</h2>Immortals Must Die is a rogue-lite that mixes aspects of Hades with Dead Cells, adding unique elements such as the gear set system, which adds more complexity and different ways of playing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/a19445ff874a105e3360e03c6cb9f423.poster.avif?t=1741530002\" width=612 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/a19445ff874a105e3360e03c6cb9f423.webm?t=1741530002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/a19445ff874a105e3360e03c6cb9f423.mp4?t=1741530002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>You are the child of a forbidden love between a goddess of light and a god of darkness. You are a god!<br><br>However, your powers were sealed with five keys given to the highest-ranking demon in five different multiverses. You were then left on Earth so that you wouldn't be found.<br><br>The gods have discovered your existence and are angry. They have imprisoned your parents and are searching for you.<br><br>You need the keys to become an immortal and face other immortals.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/480627107b78b3170c49f93c7991e6dd.poster.avif?t=1741530002\" width=612 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/480627107b78b3170c49f93c7991e6dd.webm?t=1741530002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/480627107b78b3170c49f93c7991e6dd.mp4?t=1741530002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dying is part of the job</h2>Prepare to die a lot in this game, but always in a rewarding way. Each time you die, you learn more about the game mechanics, unlock new stuff and spend what you've collected to get stronger. Collect all 5 seals to save yourself from the uncertain future.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rogue-lite</h2>Immortals Must Die is a rogue-lite that mixes aspects of Hades with Dead Cells, adding unique elements such as the gear set system, which adds more complexity and different ways of playing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/a19445ff874a105e3360e03c6cb9f423.poster.avif?t=1741530002\" width=612 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/a19445ff874a105e3360e03c6cb9f423.webm?t=1741530002\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2814760/extras/a19445ff874a105e3360e03c6cb9f423.mp4?t=1741530002\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>You are the child of a forbidden love between a goddess of light and a god of darkness. You are a god!<br><br>However, your powers were sealed with five keys given to the highest-ranking demon in five different multiverses. You were then left on Earth so that you wouldn't be found.<br><br>The gods have discovered your existence and are angry. They have imprisoned your parents and are searching for you.<br><br>You need the keys to become an immortal and face other immortals.",
